&lt;h2 id="login">Login&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Authenticate with email, password, and organization name to receive access and refresh tokens.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Queries</title><link>https://developer.haltian.io/haltian-iot/apis/service-api/queries/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://developer.haltian.io/haltian-iot/apis/service-api/queries/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="overview">Overview&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>The Service API provides GraphQL queries for retrieving devices, measurements, spaces, and assets. Queries support filtering, pagination, and field selection.&lt;/p>
